{"strongs": "H0392", "word": "אַכְזִיב", "translit": "akh.ziv", "root": "אכזיב", "morph": "N:N--L", "pos": "proper name, of a location 1.", "gloss": "in lowland of Judah", "definition": "אַכְזִיב proper name, of a location 1. in lowland of Judah Josh 15:44 ( ᵐ5 Ακιεζει καὶ Κεζειβ , ᵐ5 L Αχζειβ ), Mic 1:14 ( ᵐ5 οἴκους ματαίους ; see also כְּזִיב , כֹּזֵבָא ). 2. in Asher Judg 1:31 ( ᵐ5 Ασχαζει ), and ( אַכְזִ֫יבָה ) Josh 19:29 ( ᵐ5 Εχοζοβ , A Αχζειφ , ᵐ5 L Αχαζειβ ); it lay on the coast south of Tyre, in Assyrian Akzibi, COT Josh 19:29 Dl Par. 284 ; Greek Εκδιππα ; modern ez-Zîb , Bd Pal. 272 Buhl G. § 120 and (on pronunciation) Kasteren ZPV xiii. 101 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3981')\">BDB3981</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H392')\">H392</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3980')\">BDB3980</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3982')\">BDB3982</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אַכְזִיב</bdbheb> <div class=\"point\"><b>proper name, of a location 1.</b> <highlightword>in lowland of Judah</highlightword> <ref ref=\"Josh 15:44\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(6,15,44)\">Josh 15:44</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ακιεζει καὶ Κεζειβ</grk>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><sup><reflink>L</reflink></sup></lookup> <grk>Αχζειβ</grk>), <ref ref=\"Mic 1:14\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(33,1,14)\">Mic 1:14</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>οἴκους ματαίους</grk>; see also  <bdbheb><reflink>כְּזִיב</reflink></bdbheb>, <bdbheb>כֹּזֵבָא</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> in Asher <ref ref=\"Judg 1:31\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(7,1,31)\">Judg 1:31</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ασχαζει</grk>), and (<bdbheb>אַכְזִ֫יבָה</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Josh 19:29\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(6,19,29)\">Josh 19:29</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Εχοζοβ</grk>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('A')\"><reflink>A</reflink></lookup> <grk>Αχζειφ</grk>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><sup><reflink>L</reflink></sup></lookup> <grk>Αχαζειβ</grk>); it lay on the coast south of Tyre, in Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>Akzibi,</highlight></transliteration> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('COT')\">COT<sup><ref ref=\"Josh 19:29\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(6,19,29)\">Josh 19:29</ref></sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dl')\">Dl<sup>Par. 284</sup></lookup>; Greek <grk>Εκδιππα</grk>; modern <highlight>ez-Zîb</highlight>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bäd')\">Bd<sup>Pal. 272</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl<sup>G. § 120 and</sup></lookup> (on pronunciation) Kasteren<sup>ZPV xiii. 101</sup>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Josh 15:44", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 15, "verse": 44}, {"raw": "Mic 1:14", "book": "MIC", "chapter": 1, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Judg 1:31", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 1, "verse": 31}, {"raw": "Josh 19:29", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 19, "verse": 29}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["אַכְזִיב", "ᵐ5", "כְּזִיב", "כֹּזֵבָא", "אַכְזִ֫יבָה"], "aramaic": [], "greek": ["Ακιεζει καὶ Κεζειβ", "Αχζειβ", "οἴκους ματαίους", "Ασχαζει", "Εχοζοβ", "Αχζειφ", "Αχαζειβ", "Εκδιππα"], "translit": ["Akzibi,"], "abbreviations": ["A", "Buhl", "Bäd", "COT", "Dl", "Sept"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB3981", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}